[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0010","text":"路加，方便吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0020","text":"关于下一场演唱会，服装的形象图出来了，想让你确认一下。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0030","text":"然后，很抱歉这么突然，下周想请你拍宣传用的海报。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0040","text":"──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0050","text":"演唱会的细节还没定下来，主视觉就要先行确定了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0060","text":"可能会比较难把握拍摄的意象，没问题吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0070","text":"又是你们说了算啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0080","text":"抱歉……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0090","text":"随便你们搞。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0100","text":"会变成什么样我才不管————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
